{"id":"H7566","lemma":"רֶ֫שֶׁף","transliteration":"resheph","sayIt":"re-sheph","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Resheph","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.7.25;\nson of: Beriah (H1283H);\nbrother of: Sheerah (H7609) and Rephah (H7506);\nfather of: Telah (H8520)\n§ Resheph = \"flame\"\na son of Ephraim","glosses":["resheph his son"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-7","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Resheph his son","kjv":"also Resheph"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 7:25","note":"Rephah was his son, and Resheph, and Telah his son, Tahan his son,","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1283","lemma":"בְּרִיעָה","transliteration":"beriah","gloss":"Beriah"},{"id":"H7506","lemma":"רֶ֫פַח","transliteration":"rephach","gloss":"Rephah"},{"id":"H7609","lemma":"שֶׁאֱרָה","transliteration":"sheerah","gloss":"Sheerah"},{"id":"H8520","lemma":"תֶּ֫לַח","transliteration":"telach","gloss":"Telah"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}